      "text": "Equivariant Satake category and Kostant-Whittaker reduction — 24 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Notation and statements of the res\n\n**Equivariant Satake category and Kostant-Whittaker reduction**\n\n*KOSTANT-WHITTAKER REDUCTION*\n\n32 pp, 24 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Notation and statements of the results; 2.2 Asymptotic ˇg-modules; 2.3 Kostant functor κℏ; 2.4 Equivariant cohomology of GrG; 2.5 Equivariant homology and quantum Toda latt; 2.6 Quasiclassical limit; 2.7 Equivalences; 3 Topology; 3.3 Levi-equivariant cohomology; 3.4 Transitivity for a pair of Levi subgroups; 3.5 Tensor structure on equivariant cohomology; 4 Algebra; 4.1 Some properties of the Kostant functor κℏ; 4.2 De-symmetrized Kostant functor κℏ; 4.3 Canonical filtration on φ(V ); 4.4 Whittaker modules for Levi subalgebras",
